-- Questicus language pack: 繁體中文 - the patch notes (What's new), one entry per line of Questicus/Changelog.lua
QuesticusLocales = QuesticusLocales or {}
local t = QuesticusLocales.zhTW or {}
QuesticusLocales.zhTW = t
t["Questicus in your language: German, French, Spanish (Spain and Mexico), Italian, Portuguese (Brazil), Russian, Korean and Chinese (simplified and traditional). Each language is a small language pack on the Questicus files page on CurseForge - install the one for your language next to Questicus."] = "Questicus 支援你的語言了：德語、法語、西班牙語（西班牙和墨西哥）、義大利語、葡萄牙語（巴西）、俄語、韓語和中文（簡體和繁體）。每種語言都是 CurseForge 上 Questicus 檔案頁面中的一個小型語言包 - 在 Questicus 旁邊安裝你的語言包即可。"
t["Options > Language: every language with whether its pack is installed, a drop-down to pick one (Automatic follows the game's language), and a link to the files page."] = "選項 > 語言：列出每種語言及其語言包是否已安裝，一個用來選擇語言的下拉選單（自動 = 跟隨遊戲語言），以及檔案頁面的連結。"
t["The first-time setup now starts with the language choice."] = "首次設定現在從選擇語言開始。"
t["What's new is shown in your language too, from this version on."] = "從此版本起，更新內容也會以你的語言顯示。"
t["Escort quests stand out on the route: the step is green with an \"ESCORT QUEST\" tab, and before an escort starts Questicus asks (Start escort / Not now), even with auto-accept on."] = "護送任務在路線中更醒目：該步驟為綠色並帶有“護送任務”標簽，護送開始前 Questicus 會先詢問（開始護送 / 暫不），即使開啟了自動接受也一樣。"
t["Options > Automation: every setting where Questicus does something on its own - accepting and handing in quests, suggesting rewards, taking flights, pinning the next objective."] = "選項 > 自動化：Questicus 自行處理的所有設定 - 接受和回報任務、推薦獎勵、乘坐飛行、標記下一個目標。"
t["Accepting quests, handing them in and suggesting rewards are off until you turn them on (first-time setup or Options > Automation). They were on by default; after this update they're off once, so turn them back on if you want them."] = "接受任務、回報任務和推薦獎勵在你開啟之前都是關閉的（首次設定或選項 > 自動化）。之前預設是開啟的；本次更新後會關閉一次，需要的話請重新開啟。"
t["With Command Center installed, the Questicus icon in its dock, border bar, home page and Tools list takes the theme colour like the other tools; on its own Questicus keeps its own icon."] = "安裝了 Command Center 時，Questicus 在其停靠欄、邊欄、主頁和工具列表中的圖示會像其他工具一樣使用主題顏色；單獨使用時 Questicus 保留自己的圖示。"
t["Game clients in other languages (German, French, Spanish ...): quest objectives in your log are recognised (by name in your language, else by kind and order), so finished objectives drop out of the route and progress shows; quest, NPC and item names show in your language where the game knows them."] = "其他語言的遊戲客戶端（德語、法語、西班牙語……）：能識別你日志中的任務目標（按你語言中的名稱，否則按類型和順序），所以已完成的目標會從路線中移除並顯示進度；只要遊戲知道，任務、NPC 和物品名稱會以你的語言顯示。"
t["Hearthstone in routes: when it's ready and your inn gets you to the next step faster, the route has a \"Hearth to <inn>\" step with a Hearthstone button. Questicus learns where your hearthstone takes you when you set it at an innkeeper or use it. Options > Use my hearthstone in the route."] = "路線中的爐石：當爐石就緒且旅店能讓你更快到達下一步時，路線會有一個帶爐石按鈕的“爐石回到 <旅店>”步驟。你在旅店老板處綁定或使用爐石時，Questicus 會記住它帶你去哪裡。選項 > 在路線中使用我的爐石。"
t["A quest with a choice of rewards is never handed in on its own any more: Questicus shows the reward it would pick and why, and you press Take it (or choose another yourself)."] = "有可選獎勵的任務不再自動回報：Questicus 會顯示它會選擇的獎勵及原因，由你點擊“拿取”（或自己選擇其他獎勵）。"
t["Quest tooltips on the map, minimap, tracker and dungeon window show what the quest says to do (the objective line from the quest log) and its quest ID. Right-click a quest in the tracker for a Wowhead link to copy; Alt-click one to share it with your group."] = "地圖、小地圖、追蹤和地城視窗中的任務提示會顯示任務要求（日志中的目標行）及任務 ID。在追蹤中右鍵點擊任務可獲得可複製的 Wowhead 連結；Alt-點擊可與隊伍共享。"
t["Quest tooltips list the reward items, and the items its chain ends with; hold Alt over the tooltip to see each item's own tooltip and compare them."] = "任務提示會列出獎勵物品以及任務鏈最終給出的物品；在提示上按住 Alt 可查看每件物品自己的提示並進行比較。"
t["Respawn times count for every copy of a thing: a quest object (or mob) that comes under several ids with one name - the Pool of Tears' Atal'ai Artifacts - uses the respawn timed on any of them, so the arrow no longer sends you back to a spot after a minute when it takes seven to come back."] = "重生時間適用於同一事物的所有副本：同名但有多個 ID 的任務物體（或怪物）- 比如淚水之池的阿塔萊神器 - 會使用其中任何一個測得的重生時間，所以箭頭不會再在需要七分鐘時，一分鐘後就把你送回原處。"
t["Empty quest-object spots are given up much sooner: with the object light on (the default) the game picks objects all around you, so within about 12 yards of the marker, a second or so with nothing there moves the arrow on - no need to stand right on it for several seconds."] = "空的任務物體位置會更快被放棄：開啟物體光效（預設）時，遊戲會選中你周圍的物體，所以在標記約 11 碼內一秒左右沒有發現就會讓箭頭繼續 - 不用再站在上面等好幾秒。"
t["Dungeon window tidied up: the facts in a neat two-column table, and the quests with a status icon, a short status (Done, In your log, Eligible, Not eligible - why on hover, with + Route putting the start of its chain on your route) and the quests you can only pick up inside the dungeon in their own box, marked with the dungeon icon."] = "地城視窗整理：資訊以整齊的兩列表格顯示，任務帶有狀態圖示和簡短狀態（已完成、在日志中、可接、不可接 - 滑鼠懸停顯示原因，+ 路線 會把任務鏈開頭加入你的路線），只能在地城內接取的任務單獨放在帶地城圖示的框中。"
t["Dungeon run step tidied up: one line, \"Run <dungeon>  1/5 quests done\". Expand opens each quest's name and what's left of it on short lines, instead of a wall of quest text. A Group finder button on it opens the game's group finder."] = "地城步驟整理：一行“進行 <地城>  已完成 1/5 個任務”。展開後用簡短的行顯示每個任務的名稱和剩餘內容，而不是一大段任務文本。上面的隊伍搜尋器按鈕會開啟遊戲的隊伍搜尋器。"
t["Dungeon mode: the dungeon's quests sit together at the top of the quest tracker, under the dungeon's name on a purple band, apart from your other quests."] = "地城模式：地城的任務集中在任務追蹤頂部，位於紫色條帶上的地城名稱下方，與其他任務分開。"
t["On a flight the arrow says \"In flight to <place>\" with about how long is left, instead of pointing at the next step thousands of yards away."] = "飛行時箭頭會顯示“飛往 <地點>”和大約剩餘時間，而不是指向數千碼外的下一步。"
t["Quest dialog for ForeverDB: with \"Help fill the database\" on, every quest's texts (the offer, objectives, the \"have you got them?\" and the turn-in text) and the greetings above quest givers' lists are saved as the game shows them - your name, class and race are left out - so ForeverDB has WoW Forever's own words for every quest."] = "為 ForeverDB 記錄任務對話：開啟“幫助完善資料庫”時，每個任務的文本（任務介紹、目標、“東西拿到了嗎？”和回報文本）以及任務發布者列表上方的問候語會按遊戲顯示的樣子保存 - 你的名字、職業和種族會被去掉 - 這樣 ForeverDB 就有 WoW Forever 每個任務的原文。"
t["Stutters near walls gone: routes round walls are worked out in the background now (a few ms a frame) instead of all at once, and every leg of the route on the map is kept instead of being searched again on every redraw. The line and the arrow also no longer loop back to a corner you've already walked past."] = "牆邊卡頓消失：繞牆路徑現在在後台計算（每幀幾毫秒），而不是一次性計算，地圖上路線的每一段都會保留，不會在每次重繪時重新搜索。路線和箭頭也不會再繞回你已經走過的拐角。"
t["The waypoint moves to the new step's spot even when it's close to the last one (it was left on the previous target), and \"Get the flight path\" steps lead to the flight master himself, by whatever name he goes (Wind Rider Master, Hippogryph Master, Bat Handler...)."] = "即使新步驟的位置離上一個很近，導航點也會移到新位置（之前會停在上一個目標），“獲得飛行路線”步驟會帶你去找飛行管理員本人，不管他叫什麼（雙足飛龍管理員、角鷹獸管理員、蝙蝠管理員……）。"
t["Dungeon mode: everything inside the dungeon - its objectives, hand-ins to someone or something in there (the Idol of Hakkar, ...) and quests you can only pick up in there - waits until you've got every quest you can get outside, instead of sending you in early. Quests that start inside no longer hold the run up. Outside dungeon mode, a finished quest whose hand-in is inside a dungeon is no longer a step that sends you in: it's handed in when you're in there."] = "地城模式：地城內的一切 - 目標、交給裡面某人或某物的任務（哈卡神像……）以及只能在裡面接的任務 - 都會等到你接完所有能在外面接的任務，而不是讓你過早進去。在裡面開始的任務不再拖延進度。不在地城模式時，回報地點在地城內的已完成任務不再是讓你進去的步驟：你在裡面時就會回報。"
t["Dungeon list and window: how many of the dungeon's quests are in your log as well as how many are done, and a \"picked up inside\" mark on quests you get in the dungeon itself."] = "地城列表和視窗：顯示該地城有多少任務在你的日志中以及完成了多少，並給在地城內獲得的任務加上“在內部接取”標記。"
t["Waypoint in the world: a marker with a beam of light stands over where you're going, with the distance, when you'll get there and what it is (the step, your corpse, your own pin), coloured by what the step is. Close up it turns into a card over the target saying what it is; off screen a pointer at the edge shows which way to turn. Right-click to clear it. No other waypoint addon needed."] = "世界中的導航點：目的地上方會立起一道帶光柱的標記，顯示距離、預計到達時間和它是什麼（步驟、你的屍體、你自己的標記），顏色取決於步驟類型。靠近後它會變成目標上方的卡片，說明是什麼；不在畫面內時，畫面邊緣的指針會告訴你該往哪邊轉。右鍵點擊可清除。不再需要其他導航點插件。"
t["Your own waypoints: /way [zone] x y [name] (or /qway), /way paste for a list followed one after the other, /way clear, Ctrl-click on the minimap, a pin you put on the world map, or a map link clicked in chat - followed (arrow, map, marker in the world) until you get there, then the route again."] = "你自己的導航點：/way [區域] x y [名稱]（或 /qway），/way paste 貼上依次跟隨的列表，/way clear，Ctrl-點擊小地圖，在世界地圖上放置的圖釘，或在聊天中點擊的地圖連結 - 一直跟隨（箭頭、地圖、世界標記）直到到達，然後恢復路線。"
t["Waypoint options (Options > Waypoint, Waypoint look): pinpoint distance, edge pointer and its arrow, size, smaller with distance, opacity, beam, what's written under it, meters instead of yards, your own colours, showing it with the interface hidden, fade on mouse-over, and sounds for a new waypoint, getting close and walking away (/qc waysound for your own)."] = "導航點選項（選項 > 導航點、導航點外觀）：精確標記距離、邊緣指針及其箭頭、大小、越遠越小、不透明度、光柱、下方顯示的內容、用米代替碼、自己的顏色、隱藏介面時也顯示、滑鼠懸停時淡出，以及新導航點、靠近和離開時的音效（/qc waysound 可用自己的音效）。"
t["While you're a ghost the arrow leads you back to your corpse (\"Your corpse\", along the walkable path) and says when you're close enough to resurrect, the route line on the world map and minimap shows the path to it, the game's waypoint goes on it, and a corpse pin shows where it is on the world map and the minimap (at the minimap's edge when it's further). Back to the route once you're alive."] = "當你是靈魂時，箭頭會沿可行走的路徑帶你回到屍體（“你的屍體”），並在足夠近可以復活時提示；世界地圖和小地圖上的路線線條會顯示通往屍體的路，遊戲的導航點會放在屍體上，屍體圖釘會在世界地圖和小地圖上顯示它的位置（較遠時顯示在小地圖邊緣）。復活後恢復路線。"
t["Your findings now reach ForeverDB from inside the game: respawn times, new spawn points, zone border crossings and objects that only appear on a kill are passed quietly (addon messages, nothing in chat) to ForeverDB's collector when it's online in your guild or group, so the next ForeverDB update has them for everyone. Turn it off with \"Help fill the database\" in Options > Advanced; /qc relay shows how much got through."] = "你的發現現在可以直接從遊戲中送到 ForeverDB：重生時間、新重生點、區域邊界穿越以及只在擊殺時出現的物體，會在 ForeverDB 的收集者在你的公會或隊伍中在線時被悄悄（插件消息，聊天中不顯示）傳給它，這樣下一次 ForeverDB 更新就會為所有人包含這些資料。可在選項 > 高級中關閉“幫助完善資料庫”；/qc relay 顯示已傳送了多少。"
t["Checked walking paths: where ForeverDB has a checked walk for a route step, the arrow and the map follow it exactly instead of working the way out, and that walk isn't learned or recorded any more."] = "已核實的行走路徑：當 ForeverDB 為某個路線步驟提供了已核實的行走路徑時，箭頭和地圖會嚴格按它走，而不是自己計算路線，這條路徑也不再被學習或記錄。"
t["New spawn points: a quest mob standing next to you (out of combat) more than 30 yards from every spawn the database knows is added as a new spawn point - on your map, in the arrow's spots and in the route right away, and in ForeverDB for everyone with your recordings."] = "新重生點：你旁邊（非戰鬥中）的任務怪物若距離資料庫中所有已知重生點都超過 30 碼，就會被新增為新重生點 - 立即出現在你的地圖、箭頭位置和路線中，並隨你的記錄加入 ForeverDB 供所有人使用。"
t["Mob respawn times are learned while you play and used right away: a spot you killed at that still has no nameplate in view (not back yet), or is found back later, tightens its respawn time; the arrow re-times every skipped spot of that mob at once, and the route counts the wait for respawns when a quest needs more kills than there are spawns. Everything is saved for ForeverDB."] = "怪物重生時間會在你遊戲時學習並立即使用：你擊殺過的位置如果視野中還沒有名條（還沒刷出來），或之後再次有怪，就會修正它的重生時間；箭頭會一次性重新計算該怪物所有被跳過的位置，當任務需要的擊殺數多於重生點數時，路線會把等待重生的時間算進去。所有資料都會為 ForeverDB 保存。"
t["The route line on the map and minimap is smooth and solid now: no more stair steps and zig-zags from the path search, rounded corners - it never cuts over a wall (the arrow keeps the exact path)."] = "地圖和小地圖上的路線線條現在平滑連貫：沒有路徑搜索產生的台階和鋸齒，拐角是圓的 - 它從不穿牆（箭頭保持精確路徑）。"
t["Landing from a flight always moves the route on now: sometimes the game still said you were on the flight when it handed control back, and the \"Fly to\" step stayed after you'd landed."] = "飛行降落後路線總會繼續：有時遊戲交還控製權時仍認為你在飛行中，導致降落後“飛往”步驟還留著。"
t["Walking to a person, flight master, place or object is exact now: the arrow only turns at a corner once you're really there, an object's spot counts only when you stand on it, and explore spots need you inside - mobs keep the looser rules since they wander. Paths also go round walls marked in ForeverDB (and through the openings between them, however narrow), and the arrow only moves on from a corner round a wall's end once the way on is clear."] = "前往人物、飛行管理員、地點或物體現在很精確：箭頭只有在你真正到達時才會在拐角轉向，物體的位置只有站在上面才算，探索位置需要你進入其中 - 怪物會四處走動，所以規則更寬松。路徑還會繞開 ForeverDB 中標記的牆（並穿過牆之間的缺口，不管多窄），箭頭只有在路通了之後才會離開牆盡頭的拐角。"
t["Walking between zones follows the real passes: the arrow, the route lines on the map, travel times and the choice of flight master all go through the known crossings between zones (via a third zone if that's the way), never straight over a zone line, and each stretch between crossings still goes round walls - no more being sent to Hammerfall from the Hinterlands."] = "區域間行走會走真實的通道：箭頭、地圖上的路線線條、行程時間和飛行管理員的選擇都會經過區域間已知的通道（必要時經過第三個區域），絕不直線穿越區域邊界，通道之間的每一段仍會繞牆 - 不會再從辛特蘭把你送去落錘鎮。"
t["The arrow no longer points away from the quest mobs in front of you: while a mob for the current objectives is in view (nameplate, target or soft target, not tagged by someone else) the arrow turns into its skull and says \"<mob> in view\" (\"right here\" when it's close) instead of pointing at a spawn marker that may be a different one. Within sight it also aims straight at the target instead of along a detour."] = "箭頭不再指向遠離你面前任務怪物的方向：只要當前目標的怪物在視野中（名條、目標或軟目標，且未被他人占據），箭頭就會變成它的骷髏並顯示“<怪物> 在視野內”（靠近時顯示“就在這裡”），而不是指向可能是另一只怪的重生標記。在視野內時也會直接指向目標，而不是繞路。"
t["The arrow no longer runs you round every kill spot to find them empty: with enemy nameplates on, spawns within nameplate range whose mob isn't up (no live nameplate, or tagged by someone else) are skipped from a distance until they respawn, and open again as soon as the mob shows up. Without nameplates you get a one-time tip to turn them on."] = "箭頭不再帶你跑遍每個刷怪點卻發現是空的：開啟敵方名條時，名條範圍內怪物不在的重生點（沒有活著的名條，或被他人占據）會在遠處就被跳過，直到重生，怪物一出現就重新開放。沒有開啟名條時會提示你一次開啟它們。"
t["Options > Stat weights: set how much each stat is worth to you, per role. Gear upgrades and quest reward picks use your numbers (scroll over a number to nudge it; Back to defaults undoes it)."] = "選項 > 屬性權重：按角色定位設定每種屬性對你的價值。裝備提升和任務獎勵選擇會使用你的數值（在數值上捲動滑鼠滾輪可微調；恢復預設可撤銷）。"
t["Completionist routes now include WoW Forever's secret quest chains, starting with the Alcaz Operative Insignia (Alcaz Prison -> Moonbrook -> State Secrets), with step-by-step notes. Other routes leave secrets out."] = "全收集路線現在包含 WoW Forever 的秘密任務鏈，從奧卡茲特工徽章開始（Alcaz Prison -> 月溪鎮 -> 國家機密），並附有逐步說明。其他路線不包含這些秘密。"
t["The arrow and the route now know WoW Forever's zone borders (from ForeverDB): paths stay off the mountains, walls and open sea between zones and go through the passes people really walk, travel times count the way round, and far targets in another zone are reached through a known crossing. Where you cross a border is recorded and shared through ForeverDB (/qc zone shows where you are)."] = "箭頭和路線現在了解 WoW Forever 的區域邊界（來自 ForeverDB）：路徑會避開區域之間的山脈、牆和開闊海面，走人們真正走的通道，行程時間會計入繞路，另一個區域的遠處目標會通過已知通道到達。你穿越邊界的地點會被記錄並通過 ForeverDB 共享（/qc zone 顯示你的位置）。"
t["Objective steps now say how to do them: the quest's own instruction (\"Use the Holy Water on the corrupted Moonwell\"), the quest item to use and on what (with its key), and where each item drops from or is found."] = "目標步驟現在會說明怎麼做：任務自己的說明（“在被腐蝕的月亮井使用聖水”）、要使用的任務物品及其對象（帶按鍵），以及每件物品從哪裡掉落或在哪裡找到。"
t["Flights: on a flight path the arrow and the guide just say \"in flight\" (nothing is measured until you land), and every route you fly is timed once - the planner uses your real flight times from then on, and they go into the shared database with your recordings."] = "飛行：在飛行路線上，箭頭和指引只顯示“飛行中”（降落前不進行測量），你飛過的每條航線都會計時一次 - 之後規劃會使用你的真實飛行時間，它們也會隨你的記錄加入共享資料庫。"
t["The arrow and the route learn your way around much sooner: a wall, gate, cliff or mountain range you had to walk round is remembered (one long detour is enough), walks through caves and dungeons on the way are kept instead of dropped, ground you've walked yourself is preferred, and a chat line tells you when it learned something (/qc paths shows the last walk)."] = "箭頭和路線會更快學會你的路：你不得不繞過的牆、大門、懸崖或山脈會被記住（繞一次遠路就夠），途經洞穴和地城的行走會被保留而不是丟棄，優先選擇你自己走過的地面，學到東西時聊天中會有一行提示（/qc paths 顯示上一次行走）。"
t["Dungeon mode now finishes the chain quest you already have in the zone you're in before sending you elsewhere (e.g. Larion and Muigin in Un'Goro for the Sunken Temple): a chain step in your log was treated as already done, and quests across the sea looked \"on the way\" because the dungeon's own quests wait there."] = "地城模式現在會先完成你在當前區域已有的任務鏈任務，再把你送去別處（例如為沉沒的神廟在安戈洛環形山做的“拉瑞恩和穆爾金”）：之前日志中的任務鏈步驟會被當作已完成，海對面的任務因為地城自己的任務在那邊等著而看起來“順路”。"
t["Dungeon mode no longer fills the route with endless \"Do <quest>\" steps for a finished quest of another zone in your log (e.g. It's a Secret to Everybody in Temple of Atal'Hakkar mode). A quest whose objectives have no known place now gets one step at most."] = "地城模式不再因為日志中其他區域的已完成任務，而在路線中塞滿無窮無盡的“完成 <任務>”步驟（例如阿塔哈卡神廟模式下的“人人皆知的秘密”）。目標沒有已知地點的任務現在最多只有一個步驟。"
t["Auto accept only takes the quests your route has you pick up (or ones you added yourself). It used to accept any quest your settings allowed, so NPCs handed you quests the route had left out."] = "自動接受只會接受你的路線要你接的任務（或你自己新增的任務）。以前它會接受設定允許的任何任務，導致 NPC 給了你路線中已排除的任務。"
t["The \"Help calibrate Questicus\" respawn pop-up no longer shows for objects that only appear when you use an item on a mob or kill it (like Broodling Essence) - those have no respawn timer."] = "“幫助校準 Questicus”重生視窗不再為那些只有對怪物使用物品或擊殺怪物才會出現的物體彈出（比如雛龍精華）- 它們沒有重生時間。"
t["Much less lag and stutter while questing: the arrow and the map reuse the way they worked out instead of working it out again many times a second, the route is only planned again when a quest is taken, done or an objective finishes (at most every 5 seconds, never in collection mode), and opening, zooming and keeping the world map open makes much less garbage."] = "做任務時卡頓大大減少：箭頭和地圖會重複使用已計算好的路線，而不是每秒重新計算很多次，路線只會在接受或完成任務、或目標完成時重新規劃（最多每 5 秒一次，收集模式下從不），開啟、縮放和保持世界地圖開啟時產生的垃圾資料也少得多。"
t["Much less memory churn (the stutters every few seconds): minimap icons are only redrawn when you've moved, turned or the route changed, tooltips are made only when you point at an icon, and opening the world map no longer builds megabytes of temporary data."] = "內存周轉大大減少（每隔幾秒的卡頓）：小地圖圖示只在你移動、轉向或路線變化時重繪，提示只在你指向圖示時才生成，開啟世界地圖也不再生成好幾 MB 的臨時資料。"
t["The route no longer sends you to quest givers who won't talk to you: quests that need reputation you don't have, quests from a faction you're unfriendly or hostile with (like Timbermaw before you've earned them), and quests whose NPCs you've seen are hostile to you are left out until that changes."] = "路線不再把你送到不會和你說話的任務發布者那裡：需要你沒有的聲望的任務、來自你不友好或敵對陣營的任務（例如尚未贏得好感的木喉要塞），以及 NPC 已被發現對你敵對的任務，在情況改變前都會被排除。"
t["Highlights: ore, herbs, quest objects, chests and your fishing bobber light up as you come up to them, with 15 light effects, the object's name and icon, colours per kind of object, and a live preview (Options > Highlights, or /qc glow)."] = "醒目提示：礦石、草藥、任務物體、寶箱和你的浮標在你靠近時會亮起，有 15 種光效、物體的名稱和圖示、按物體類型區分的顏色和實時預覽（選項 > 醒目提示，或 /qc glow）。"
t["Questicus now records much more for the shared quest database while you play (money and skinning per creature, fishing per zone, flight prices, trainers and every ability's training cost, everything vendors sell with its price, limits, token costs and requirements, quest details and reputation, which quests NPCs really offer, rares, subzones, encounters, gathering skill levels) - /qc recorded shows what it has. Turn it off under Options > Advanced."] = "Questicus 現在會在你遊戲時為共享任務資料庫記錄更多內容（每種生物的金錢和剝皮、每個區域的釣魚、飛行價格、訓練師及每個技能的訓練費用、商人出售的所有物品及價格、限購、代幣花費和需求、任務詳情和聲望、NPC 實際提供的任務、稀有怪物、子區域、首領戰、採集技能等級）- /qc recorded 顯示已記錄的內容。可在選項 > 高級中關閉。"
t["Highlights options: hide the light in combat, in instances, on things you can't use yet or on herbs and ore without the profession; ignore objects; pick the range and direction; set the interact key; cut the light out around your character; alternate Find Herbs and Find Minerals if you have both."] = "醒目提示選項：在戰鬥中、副本中、對你還不能使用的東西或沒有專業的草藥和礦石隱藏光效；忽略物體；選擇範圍和方向；設定互動按鍵；在你的角色周圍鏤空光效；同時擁有兩個採集專業時交替使用尋找草藥和尋找礦物。"
t["Vendor gear on the route: no more plain white items (weapons still count), and only when buying it still leaves enough gold for your class training at the next level (what your trainer showed you, or what other players' trainers showed - every ability's training cost is now recorded and shared through the database)."] = "路線中的商人裝備：不再包含普通白色物品（武器仍然計算），並且只有在購買後仍有足夠金幣支付下一級的職業訓練費用時才會推薦（你的訓練師顯示的費用，或其他玩家的訓練師顯示的費用 - 每個技能的訓練費用現在都會被記錄並通過資料庫共享）。"
t["Quests that let you choose a profession book (Mining for Dummies, Wild Harvest, Pelt Collecting for Beginners ...) are never handed in with a pick made for you: the reward window stays open so you choose."] = "需要選擇專業書的任務（採礦入門、野外採集、剝皮入門……）絕不會替你做出選擇後回報：獎勵視窗會保持開啟，由你自己選擇。"
t["Kill and collect objectives: the arrow points to the closest spot, leaning toward your next step so you work through the area in that direction. Spots you just cleared, or where there was nothing, are skipped until they respawn; respawn times are measured while you play and shared through the database (1 minute until one is known). A quest object nobody has timed yet asks you once to wait for it to come back, so no one else has to. /qc respawn shows them."] = "擊殺和收集目標：箭頭指向最近的位置，並偏向你的下一步，讓你朝那個方向推進。你剛清空或沒有東西的位置會被跳過直到重生；重生時間會在遊戲中測量並通過資料庫共享（未知時為 1 分鐘）。還沒人計時過的任務物體會請你等它重生一次，這樣其他人就不必再等。/qc respawn 顯示這些時間。"
t["The options window is tidied into sections (General, Questing, Map & minimap, Tracker & alerts, Dungeons, Highlights, Advanced), each a short page with plainer wording; closing the highlight settings takes you back to it."] = "選項視窗整理成多個部分（常規、任務、地圖和小地圖、追蹤和提醒、地城、醒目提示、高級），每個都是用語更簡單的短頁面；關閉醒目提示設定會回到選項視窗。"
t["Collect-from-object quests (like Harvesting Windstones) no longer get sent to the back of the route because a creature you had just killed was taken for where the items come from; abandoning and retaking a quest is planned fresh; the guide's \"Done:\" line now reads \"Last step:\" so it isn't mistaken for the quest being finished."] = "從物體上收集的任務（如收集風之石）不會再因為你剛擊殺的生物被誤認為物品來源而被排到路線末尾；放棄後重新接受的任務會重新規劃；指引的“已完成：”一行現在改為“上一步：”，以免被誤認為任務已完成。"
t["Quest XP, gold and reward items now always come from the game itself (your quest log, the quest windows, what you really got) instead of the database whenever the game has shown them; differences are saved so the shared database gets corrected."] = "任務經驗、金幣和獎勵物品現在只要遊戲顯示過，就總是來自遊戲本身（你的日志、任務視窗、你實際獲得的東西），而不是來自資料庫；差異會被保存，以修正共享資料庫。"
t["Routes skip quests other players found their quest giver doesn't offer yet."] = "路線會跳過其他玩家發現任務發布者尚未提供的任務。"
t["Collection mode now turns every Questicus feature off - map and minimap icons, nameplate marks and tooltip lines, the quest tracker, pop-ups, the quest item button, the boss tracker and highlights - and back on when you leave it."] = "收集模式現在會關閉 Questicus 的所有功能 - 地圖和小地圖圖示、名條標記和提示行、任務追蹤、彈出提示、任務物品按鈕、首領追蹤和醒目提示 - 離開收集模式時再重新開啟。"
t["Opening the world map no longer redraws the quest areas when nothing has changed."] = "在沒有任何變化時，開啟世界地圖不再重繪任務區域。"
t["Fixed an error (\"secret number value\") with the world map open while another addon's frames were in combat."] = "修復了在其他插件的視窗處於戰鬥中時開啟世界地圖出現的錯誤（“secret number value”）。"
t["The What's new window keeps its text inside the window, waits until you've answered the setup questions, and on a first install shows only the latest version's notes."] = "更新內容視窗會把文字保持在視窗內，等你回答完設定問題後才顯示，首次安裝時只顯示最新版本的說明。"
t["Mob tooltips show about how much money a kill drops and, if you know Skinning, what skinning it gives (real WoW: Forever counts from Drop Tables). /qc mobinfo turns it off."] = "怪物提示會顯示一次擊殺大約掉多少錢，如果你會剝皮，還會顯示剝皮能獲得什麼（來自 Drop Tables 的 WoW: Forever 真實資料）。/qc mobinfo 可關閉。"
t["The yellow waypoint marker no longer covers the step icon on the world map: it turns see-through while it sits on the icon."] = "黃色導航點標記不再遮住世界地圖上的步驟圖示：它位於圖示上時會變成半透明。"
t["The world map window's close and full-screen buttons are no longer hidden under the quest log's search bar."] = "世界地圖視窗的關閉和全屏按鈕不再被任務日誌的搜索欄擋住。"
t["Boss tracker: every boss gets its own still, round portrait (no more blank skulls or moving models), and names sit under the pictures instead of running over them."] = "首領追蹤：每個首領都有自己静止的圓形頭像（不再有空白骷髏或會動的模型），名字放在圖片下方，而不是壓在圖片上。"
t["Boss tracker: a boss you've killed this run turns into a skull with a tick; hover it to see what it dropped and who got it."] = "首領追蹤：本輪中你擊殺的首領會變成帶勾的骷髏；滑鼠懸停可查看它掉落了什麼以及誰拿到了。"
t["The yellow waypoint marker on Questicus Maps' stitched map now goes under Questicus' step icon too."] = "Questicus Maps 拼接地圖上的黃色導航點標記現在也會位於 Questicus 步驟圖示下方。"
t["The quest log's search bar keeps the size it has while you type, instead of stretching when it's empty."] = "任務日誌的搜索欄在輸入時保持大小，不會在為空時被拉伸。"
t["The quest log's search bar on the world map no longer flickers or covers the buttons beside it."] = "世界地圖上任務日誌的搜索欄不再閃爍，也不再遮住旁邊的按鈕。"
t["The game's yellow waypoint marker now sits under Questicus' step icon on the world map, so you can read the step and its number."] = "遊戲的黃色導航點標記現在位於世界地圖上 Questicus 步驟圖示的下方，你可以看清步驟和編號。"
t["The quest log no longer collapses and reopens every so often while you quest, and quest areas aren't redrawn as you walk between the spots of the same step (the map pin only moves when your route moves on to another step)."] = "做任務時任務日誌不再時不時折疊又展開，在同一步驟的各位置之間走動時任務區域也不再重繪（地圖圖釘只在路線進入下一步時移動）。"
t["The world map no longer redraws quest areas and icons all the time. They're drawn once and only redrawn when your route changes, you accept or hand in a quest, or after a loading screen. Only the line from you to your current step follows you as you move."] = "世界地圖不再一直重繪任務區域和圖示。它們只繪製一次，只有在路線變化、你接受或回報任務、或載入畫面之後才會重繪。只有從你到當前步驟的線會跟著你移動。"
t["Map icons no longer flash big for a moment while you zoom or drag the world map, or when quest areas are redrawn."] = "縮放或拖曳世界地圖、或重繪任務區域時，地圖圖示不再瞬間放大閃爍。"
t["The quest log's search bar on the world map no longer stretches off past the quest log."] = "世界地圖上任務日誌的搜索欄不再延伸到任務日誌之外。"
t["Questicus now tells you when a newer version is out (it checks with guild and group members who use it)."] = "Questicus 現在會在有新版本時通知你（它會向使用它的公會和隊伍成員確認）。"
t["Patch notes: after an update, the first time you log in you'll see what's new. Type /qc news to see them again."] = "更新說明：更新後第一次登入時你會看到更新內容。輸入 /qc news 可再次查看。"
t["With escort quests turned off, escort quests (like Ringo in Un'Goro) no longer end up on your route."] = "關閉護送任務後，護送任務（比如安戈洛環形山的林格）不會再出現在你的路線中。"
t["The quest tracker's fold button sits in the far right corner, and the title bar stays put when you fold or unfold it."] = "任務追蹤的折疊按鈕位於最右側角落，折疊或展開時標題欄保持不動。"
t["The route window remembers where you put it when you open it from Command Center or the minimap button."] = "從 Command Center 或小地圖按鈕開啟路線視窗時，它會記住你放置的位置。"
t["The minimap button follows Command Center's minimap shape, and route lines fit square minimaps."] = "小地圖按鈕會跟隨 Command Center 的小地圖形狀，路線線條也適配方形小地圖。"
t["The quest tracker can be resized (drag the corner, right-click it to fit) and scrolls when your quests don't fit."] = "任務追蹤可以調整大小（拖曳角落，右鍵點擊自動適配），任務放不下時可以捲動。"
t["The quest tracker can be folded down to its title bar."] = "任務追蹤可以折疊到只剩標題欄。"
t["Boss portraits show the first time you open the boss tracker."] = "第一次開啟首領追蹤時就會顯示首領頭像。"
t["The level and time-to-level text no longer overlaps the route window's title when the window is narrow."] = "路線視窗較窄時，等級和升級所需時間的文字不再與視窗標題重疊。"
t["Stat priority in the setup questions is now picked from a drop-down list."] = "設定問題中的屬性優先級現在從下拉列表中選擇。"
t["Dungeon run history: time, gold, XP and loot (and who got it) for every run, with averages. Type /qc runs."] = "地城記錄：每一輪的用時、金幣、經驗和掉落（以及誰拿到），並附平均值。輸入 /qc runs。"
t["Pictures for every dungeon in the list."] = "列表中的每個地城都有圖片了。"
t["Boss kills in your current run are tracked more reliably."] = "更可靠地記錄當前這一輪中的首領擊殺。"
t["The quest list on a dungeon's page scrolls."] = "地城頁面上的任務列表可以捲動。"
t["The boss tracker's low profile mode no longer has text running into the buttons."] = "首領追蹤的精簡模式不再有文字壓到按鈕上。"
t["Every WoW Forever dungeon is in the dungeon list, with its real bosses."] = "WoW Forever 的每個地城都在地城列表中，並帶有真實的首領。"
t["Low profile boss tracker - click a boss name for its loot."] = "精簡首領追蹤 - 點擊首領名字查看其掉落。"
t["The dungeon list shows how many of its quests you've done; finished dungeons turn green with a check."] = "地城列表顯示你完成了其中多少任務；全部完成的地城會變成綠色並帶勾。"
t["Dungeon pages show the average gold per run and the state of each quest (done, ready to get, or needs a chain first), with a button to add a chain to your route."] = "地城頁面顯示每輪平均金幣和每個任務的狀態（已完成、可接，或需要先完成任務鏈），並有一個把任務鏈加入路線的按鈕。"
t["All zones, including the new WoW Forever zones, are in the zone list."] = "所有區域，包括 WoW Forever 的新區域，都在區域列表中。"
t["Quest NPCs no longer show up in boss lists."] = "任務 NPC 不再出現在首領列表中。"
t["The map pictures are included in the download again."] = "下載中重新包含了地圖圖片。"
